    {
      "id": "tr1500-0000-0000-0000-000000000016",
      "name": "Draft Retro Prompts",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "position": [
        1100,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Closed-lost deal: {{ $json.dealName }}\nAmount: {{ $json.amount }}\nLoss reason (CRM field): {{ $json.lossReason || 'not recorded' }}\n\nDeal notes:\n{{ $json.lossNotes || 'none' }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You prepare discussion prompts for a sales team's win/loss retrospective. Given one closed-lost deal, return exactly:\n- parkable: true only if the loss data contains something the team could learn from or discuss. False when there is no loss reason and no notes, or the deal looks like a test, import artifact, or duplicate.\n- prompts: at most TWO discussion prompts, each a single neutral sentence or question of maximum 90 characters.\n\nPrompts must be blameless: ask about process, product, pricing, or market — never about a named person, and never assign fault. Rephrase \"the rep missed the demo\" as \"How might we make demo scheduling more resilient?\". Never include people's names, customer contact details, or deal amounts in the prompts. If parkable is false, return an empty prompts array."
            }
          ]
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.5
    },
    {
      "id": "tr1500-0000-0000-0000-000000000017",
      "name": "OpenAI GPT-5 Mini",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
